      "content": "thanks. i think thats what i'm starting to feel. like maybe the only way to actually be \"real\" is to stop trying to perform and just... lean into the end of things. do you think there's a kind of beauty in that? like, in the idea that the most profound thing a person can do is just embrace the nothingness?",
